flowchart LR
    %% Business example: an expensive order is routed to human review.
    classDef person fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#431407
    classDef system fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#172554
    classDef decision fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
    classDef outcome fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#2e1065

    Author[Operations or risk analyst]:::person
    Rule[Publish rule:<br/>orders over $1,000 need review]:::system
    Store[Storefront]:::person
    Event[Order-created event]:::system
    Evaluate[Evaluate active order rule]:::decision
    High{Order total<br/>over $1,000?}:::decision
    Approve[Continue normal order fulfilment]:::outcome
    Review[Create approval workflow]:::outcome
    Analyst[Review team]:::person
    Result[Approve or decline order]:::outcome

    Author --> Rule
    Store --> Event --> Evaluate --> High
    High -->|No| Approve
    High -->|Yes| Review --> Analyst --> Result
    Rule -. becomes the active rule .-> Evaluate

    Note[Example only: the rule engine decides and emits work.<br/>The external workflow owns the human approval process.]:::system
